OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fdying away from the east through the
OL,7,Fevening, to leave a largely dry but
OL,8,Fincreasingly cloudy night. Brisk
OL,9,Fwesterly winds easing overnight as
OL,10,Fthey back to the southwest.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FQuite windy. Many dry
OL,13,Fthrough to mid-afternoon with some
OL,14,Fearly brightness in east. Patchy rain
OL,15,Fin far west building and extending to
OL,16,Frest of area late afternoon to early
OL,17,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
