OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FEarly
OL,6,Frain Thursday across the east and
OL,7,Fsouth, clearing erratically as
OL,8,Fbrighter spells and showers feed from
OL,9,Fwest. Scattered showers for Friday,
OL,10,Ffocused in west. Saturday mainly dry,
OL,11,Foccasionally bright.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
